      "role": "user",
      "content": "he's really not taking the sips, he just spits them back out. i have some salt tablets in the cabinet for when i go hiking, would it be okay if i just crushed one up and put it in some juice or something? i feel like he needs a stronger dose of salt to really hold onto the fluids since he's so sleepy.",
